setstring english custom_mp_honor_desctiption "Honor Guardsman, or simply Honor Guard, was a notable rank of highly-skilled Covenant warriors, who were employed within the Covenant Honor Guard unit"
setstring english custom_mp_ranger "Ranger"
setstring english custom_mp_ranger_desctiption "The Sangheili Ranger is a Covenant Sangheili Special Warfare Group member, a class of highly skilled Fleet Security soldiers who focus on extra-vehicular activity (EVA) warfare"
